WHY THIS RATHER THAN A PERMISSIVE LICENCE

A permissive licence (MIT, Apache-2.0) cannot be taken back from a version
already published under it. This project may become a commercial product, and
that choice is easier to make later than to unmake. Choosing restriction now
leaves the decision open; choosing permission now closes it.

THIRD-PARTY DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THIS

This licence governs this project's own source code and nothing else.

The repository contains no provider data. It contains the code that fetches
and interprets data from FootyStats and from the dcaribou/transfermarkt-datasets
snapshot, and each carries its own terms, which apply independently and are not
affected by anything written here. Neither the presence of that code nor this
licence grants any right over their data. Anyone running this against those
sources is subject to their terms directly.

